            237 => 
            array (
                'id' => 249,
                'user_id' => 13,
                'title' => 'Industrial IoT Dashboard UIUX Design | Alerts',
                'description' => 'A modern Industrial IoT alerts dashboard designed to simplify real-time incident monitoring, system warnings, and operational issue management through a clean and scalable enterprise interface.

The dashboard focuses on helping teams identify, prioritize, and respond to critical alerts faster by organizing complex operational data into a structured and easy-to-scan workflow. Key monitoring metrics such as total alerts, critical issues, warnings, and resolved incidents are highlighted through lightweight analytical cards that improve visibility and decision-making speed.

The alerts management table was designed to support high-density monitoring environments while maintaining readability and usability. Alert severity, device sources, timestamps, and operational statuses are organized using clear hierarchy and color-based indicators to help teams quickly understand system conditions and take action efficiently.

The dark-mode enterprise design system improves focus during long monitoring sessions while creating a modern and premium industrial SaaS experience. Careful attention was placed on spacing, typography contrast, and scalable dashboard patterns to ensure the interface remains accessible and visually balanced even with large amounts of operational data.

This concept was designed for Industrial IoT platforms, AI-powered monitoring systems, manufacturing operations, security monitoring products, and enterprise analytics tools looking to combine real-time operational management with modern UI/UX design principles.',
                'image_url' => 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47732637/file/9fcc3e17665b739cd0aabec4daef96c1.jpg?resize=400x0',
                'created_at' => '2026-05-15 19:00:26',
                'updated_at' => '2026-05-15 19:00:26',
            ),
