            285 => 
            array (
                'id' => 297,
                'user_id' => 54,
                'title' => 'MTL Visual Identity',
                'description' => 'Mind The Lap is a productivity method built on a concrete premise: motivation gets you moving, but small actions keep you in motion

Together with Alessia Visicaro, we built a visual identity that translates this idea into a language made of laps, dots, and progression.

The symbol is born from the lines of running tracks. The dot lettering transforms every word into a sum of minimum units. Images use the same treatment, bringing movement and consistency into a coherent visual system.

Little Actions Power: small actions, one lap at a time.

Check out my services:
https://dribbble.com/calvino_antonio/services

Or just contact me here on Dribbble.

