                'user_id' => 33,
                'title' => 'NOMMM — Snack Brand Logo Concept',
                'description' => 'A playful logo concept created for a snack brand built around taste, craving, and instant reaction.

The idea was to turn the expression “nommm” into a bold visual mark by combining typography with a stylized mouth shape — creating something simple, memorable, and full of personality.

Focused on soft curves, chunky lettering, and strong contrast to give the brand a fun, modern, and highly recognizable feel across packaging and digital applications.

Minimal. Tasty. Loud enough to make you hungry.',
