                'title' => 'F+C - AI Fiat & Crypto app',
                'description' => 'We designed F+C - a unified finance ecosystem that brings fiat and crypto together in one simple mobile experience. The goal was to make crypto feel familiar, accessible, and intuitive for everyday users instead of overwhelming and overly technical.

We crafted a clean and modern interface inspired by the simplicity of digital banking apps, removing the typical “crypto bro” complexity. The experience focuses on clarity, seamless navigation, and a balanced visual system that helps users manage traditional money and digital assets from a single wallet.

The app combines instant fiat-to-crypto swaps, unified balances, crypto spending cards, smart risk insights, and auto-diversification into one connected ecosystem. The result is a seamless financial experience designed for mass adoption - where crypto naturally becomes part of everyday life.',
