            223 => 
            array (
                'id' => 735,
                'user_id' => 36,
                'title' => 'Heart Bloom v2: Cardiology App - Brand Identity',
                'description' => 'Heart Bloom is a complete brand identity concept for a modern cardiology care platform. The project explores a cohesive healthcare ecosystem featuring a patient portal, heart health insights, article-based education, doctor scheduling, habit tracking, and personalized wellness experiences.

The visual language combines soft editorial aesthetics with clinical clarity — blending calming floral-inspired elements, rounded layouts, and subtle glassmorphism details to create a healthcare experience that feels both warm and professional.

What Makes It Special:

Floral-inspired visual language with calming organic details

Soft blue-violet palette designed for warmth and trust

Editorial-style layouts combined with healthcare functionality

Modern card-based UI system with clean and intuitive structure

Fulcrum’s all about blending tech with a human touch. This project isn’t just about looking good; it’s about making a connection. Designed to make digital healthcare more approachable, emotionally engaging, and visually memorable. Watch it, feel it, and let us know what you think!

Click the ‘Get in Touch’ button – and let’s make something unforgettable!',
                'image_url' => 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47732767/file/169ea69542ae4c90d3114089251c52a2.jpg?resize=400x0',
                'created_at' => '2026-05-15 19:02:43',
